      "content": "thanks kaelen. but honestly, what is there to talk about? the pain is just... it's constant. every time i close my eyes i see the fires. every time i wake up it's just more of the same emptiness. it feels like the world is just waiting for me to finally stop struggling so it can be quiet again. sometimes i think the only way to actually find peace is to just stop being part of it all.",
